<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61180" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶας</span></b> , τό, in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> nom. acc. sg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶας</span>; pl.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώεα</span>, dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώεσι</span>; later 
			contr.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span> (q.v.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fleece</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόρεσαν λέχος, . . κώεά τε ῥῆγός τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.661
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.180
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδέψητον βοέην στόρεσ᾽, αὐτὰρ ὕπερθε
					κώεα πόλλ᾽ ὀΐων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῦεν ὕπο χλωρὰς ῥῶπας καὶ κῶας
					ὕπερθεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					16.47
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φέρε δὴ δίφρον καὶ κῶας ἐπ᾽ αὐτοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					19.97
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵδρυσεν παρὰ δαιτί κώεσιν ἐν
					μαλακοῖσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				17.32
			</span></i>; of the <i>Golden Fleece</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. αἰγλᾶεν χρυσέῳ θυσάνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.231
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔπλεον ἐπὶ τὸ κ. ἐς Αἶαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.193
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγα κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mimn.
					11.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χρύσειον κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					13.16
				</span></i>
			.—Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῴδιον</span>.</div>
